msgstr "Le document traduit était vide."

#: Api/SupertextClient.cs
msgctxt "Supertext.OrchardCore.Translation.Services.SupertextMessages"
msgid "No Supertext API key configured (Settings → Supertext, or SUPERTEXT_API_KEY). No Supertext account yet? Create one at https://www.supertext.com/person/en/account/signin. Generate your API key at https://www.supertext.com/en/integrations/api (supertext.com → Integrations → API, requires the Admin role)."
msgstr "Aucune clé API Supertext n’est configurée (Paramètres → Supertext, ou SUPERTEXT_API_KEY). Pas encore de compte Supertext ? Créez-en un sur https://www.supertext.com/person/en/account/signin. Générez votre clé API sur https://www.supertext.com/en/integrations/api (supertext.com → Integrations → API, rôle Admin requis)."

#: Api/SupertextClient.cs
msgctxt "Supertext.OrchardCore.Translation.Services.SupertextMessages"
msgid "Could not reach Supertext."
msgstr "Impossible de joindre Supertext."

#: Api/SupertextClient.cs
msgctxt "Supertext.OrchardCore.Translation.Services.SupertextMessages"
msgid "Authentication failed. Please check the Supertext API key. No Supertext account yet? Create one at https://www.supertext.com/person/en/account/signin. Generate your API key at https://www.supertext.com/en/integrations/api (supertext.com → Integrations → API, requires the Admin role)."
msgstr "Échec de l’authentification. Veuillez vérifier la clé API Supertext. Pas encore de compte Supertext ? Créez-en un sur https://www.supertext.com/person/en/account/signin. Générez votre clé API sur https://www.supertext.com/en/integrations/api (supertext.com → Integrations → API, rôle Admin requis)."

msgctxt "Supertext.OrchardCore.Translation.Services.SupertextMessages"
